caelum (1.5.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.5.4.
    - Your own photo as landscape (Settings -> Sky): built locally with
      GdkPixbuf and cairo from the one file picked through the file
      chooser; JPEG/PNG only, size-capped, saved without metadata, with a
      preview before use.
    - Default location is a public city-centre point at ~1 km precision.

 -- Juliowilly <jw.adamagaba@gmail.com>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:14:38 +0000

caelum (1.5.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.5.3.
    - Personal landscapes: read from <data dir>/caelum/landscapes/ (in the
      snap, its revision-independent common folder) and listed in Settings
      after the shipped ones.
    - Fixed a thin line across the sky at the top of a landscape band.

