caelum (1.5.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.5.2.
    - Wallpaper: one "Live sky as wallpaper" switch, updated every minute.
      GNOME's lock screen shows the desktop wallpaper blurred and ignores its
      own picture, so the "Lock screen only" choice is removed (migrated to
      off; desktop/both choices stay on).
    - Settings → About lists the observation and forecast intervals.
    - Correction to 1.5.1: the snap does not refresh while Caelum runs;
      snapd updates it once Caelum is closed.

 -- Juliowilly <jw.adamagaba@gmail.com>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:21:37 +0000

caelum (1.5.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.5.1.
    - Weather now from observations: rain from radar (MET Norway Nowcast,
      RainViewer) or the nearest airport's METAR; clouds, temperature,
      humidity and wind from the nearest airport or MET Nowcast; forecasts
      as the fallback. Settings shows the source of each.
    - Snap: refreshes while running, with a restart note in the app.

 -- Juliowilly <jw.adamagaba@gmail.com>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:54:12 +0000

caelum (1.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.5.0.
    - Rain and snow reworked: continuous falling layers behind and in front
      of the landscape, wind slant, haze over the distance, rain shafts,
      darker rain clouds and wet ground; lightning only for thunderstorms.
    - Security: location detection over HTTPS (ipwho.is, ipapi.co fallback)
      with validated replies; coordinates sent to online services rounded to
      2 decimals; markup escaped; HTTPS-only requests with a size cap.
    - Removed the obsolete phone-compass bridge script.

 -- Juliowilly <jw.adamagaba@gmail.com>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:04:32 +0000

